 *  value recorded for those dated settings, by key, oldest from-date first, and the proof threshold in force on the sheet's today ("" for none), and each action's permission, by action: the roles that may take it, comma separated ("" for the standing rule), and the grace days ("" for off; not dated), and every delegation of the steward role, in the order given, and the note threshold in force on the sheet's today ("" for none), the entry date ("" for off) and the pot ("" for none; not dated), and the alert threshold ("" for off; not dated), and the escalation gap in days ("" for off; not dated), and the review SLA in days ("" for none; not dated), and the proof kinds, comma separated ("" for none; not dated)
 *  and the parent sheet id ("" for none; not dated), and the default grade ("" for A; not dated). */
public record SettingsResponse(String clerkLimit, String floor, String terms, String latePct, String policyDate, String periodNumberingFrom, List<RoleResponse> roles, java.util.Map<String, String> gradeTerms, String cap, java.util.Map<String, List<DatedValue>> dated, String proofThreshold, java.util.Map<String, String> perms, String graceDays, List<DelegationResponse> delegations, String noteThreshold, String entryDate, String pot, String parent, String fiscalStartMonth, String alertThreshold, String rounding, String reviewThreshold, String escalateAfter, String reviewSla, String proofKinds, String defaultGrade) {
}

